1
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:16,470
Where can you be, my love?

2
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:21,310
I can’t reach you tonight.

3
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:28,480
Why don’t you answer your phone?

4
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:34,370
Have you vanished from my life?

5
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,310
Are you trying to run away,

6
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:48,910
Leaving nothing left to say?

7
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:56,070
Every silent passing hour

8
00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:02,930
Steals a little of my power.

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,650
When I met you, I believed

10
00:01:07,700 --> 00:01:11,490
You were the one meant for me.

11
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:14,550
Side by side through every day,

12
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:17,950
You would never walk away.

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,030
Now you escape…

14
00:01:21,110 --> 00:01:23,710
What have I done wrong?

15
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,730
I need to know

16
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:30,610
Before you’re really gone.

17
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:33,940
I fear to stay alone,

18
00:01:34,130 --> 00:01:37,460
Love has always been my way.

19
00:01:37,510 --> 00:01:41,840
I can’t help this aching heart

20
00:01:41,890 --> 00:01:44,320
Since your love went away.

21
00:02:13,670 --> 00:02:16,660
Every memory calls your name,

22
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:20,570
Nothing feels the same.

23
00:02:21,020 --> 00:02:24,150
Empty rooms and sleepless nights

24
00:02:24,200 --> 00:02:28,050
Hide my tears from morning light.

25
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:31,330
If I hurt you, let me know,

26
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,460
Don’t disappear without a word.

27
00:02:33,510 --> 00:02:38,520
One last chance is all I pray,

28
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:41,360
Don’t let love just fade away.

29
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:46,290
If there’s still a spark inside,

30
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:49,910
Don’t let all our dreams just die.

31
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:53,230
Take my hand, don’t close the door,

32
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,530
We can find what we had before.

33
00:02:55,580 --> 00:02:57,730
Now you escape…

34
00:02:57,800 --> 00:03:01,450
What have I done wrong?

35
00:03:01,690 --> 00:03:04,690
I need to know,

36
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:08,390
I’ve waited for so long.

37
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:11,750
I fear to stay alone,

38
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:15,300
Love is still my only way.

39
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:20,690
My heart will never cease to weep

40
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:25,820
Until you find your way.

41
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:32,880
Where can you be, my love?

42
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:39,930
I’m still waiting here for you…

